@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam classBorderColor #456575
skinparam packageBackgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide empty members
title Kiến trúc thành phần MiniMart
actor "Nhân viên" as u
component "React Web" as web
component "API Gateway" as gw
package "Business services" {
 component "Identity" as identity
 component "Product" as product
 component "Inventory" as inventory
 component "Sales\nSaga + Outbox Publisher" as sales
 component "Report\nConsumer + Projection" as report
}
node "PostgreSQL (một instance)" {
 database identity_db as di
 database product_db as dp
 database inventory_db as dv
 database sales_db as ds
 database report_db as dr
}
queue "RabbitMQ" as mq
u --> web
web --> gw : /api/v1 REST
gw --> identity
gw --> product
gw --> inventory
gw --> sales
gw --> report
product ..> identity : live session
inventory ..> identity : live session
sales ..> identity : live session
report ..> identity : live session
inventory --> product : private batch + catalog pages
sales --> product : private batch
sales --> inventory : lookup / reserve / commit / release
report --> inventory : summary (catalog-wide)
sales --> mq : persistent + mandatory + confirm
mq --> report : manual ACK; retry / DLQ
identity --> di
product --> dp
inventory --> dv
sales --> ds
report --> dr
note bottom of inventory
Catalog + stock merge: bản ghi kho thiếu → tồn 0.
HTTP nội bộ: service credential + correlation ID.
Commit truyền cashierId → SALE.actorId.
end note
note bottom of ds
Mỗi service chỉ đọc/ghi DB sở hữu.
Không có cross-database query/FK.
end note
@enduml
